@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:……射穿泽渡可可额头的人，<br>是黑部奈叶香。|#0202Adv19_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:经过投票，奈叶香当选为【魔女】。|#0202Adv19_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着奈叶香静静认罪的模样，<br>我们不知该对她说些什么。|#0202Adv19_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香做了错误的事）|#0202Adv19_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但，对艾玛心怀杀意的我，<br>　真的有资格指责她吗？）|#0202Adv19_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香犯下的命案，<br>让我感觉像被泼了盆冷水。|#0202Adv19_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回过神来，曾经无比膨胀的杀意，<br>如今已经彻底消退。|#0202Adv19_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（更准确地说，<br>　是因为奈叶香我才冷静下来的）|#0202Adv19_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我变得不正常了。<br>　而奈叶香也是——）|#0202Adv19_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每个人都会对他人感到厌烦或憎恶。<br>这是人之常情。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果那时，恰好手握杀人工具。<br>如果那时，魔女的杀意突然增强。|#0202Adv19_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——自己是否会情不自禁地扣动扳机。|#0202Adv19_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那样的话，当选【魔女】的<br>　就是我了）|#0202Adv19_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

