@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:审判庭内弥漫着一股<br>对奈叶香的状况感到共鸣、同情的氛围。|#0202Adv19_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
