@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是搞不懂啊。|#0202Adv19_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙低声嘟哝了一句。|#0202Adv19_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:我每天都烦你们所有人烦得要死，<br>有时候甚至想杀了你们。|#0202Adv19_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:但我只是想想而已，绝对不会真的下手。<br>就算自杀，我也会阻止自己杀人。|#0202Adv19_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我真的搞不懂。<br>到底是什么力量推动你下手的。<br>为什么非得是泽渡被杀啊。|#0202Adv19_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:给我解释清楚啊。<br>把你的想法全都说出来啊！|#0202Adv19_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Alisa-Front Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:……刚才我说的就是全部了。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想阻止泽渡可可的计划。<br>但她不听劝，所以我对她萌生了杀意。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的就只是这样而已。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

