[PrintTextModified Text:嗯——大概明白是怎么回事了，<br>但我们还是不知道可可的计划是什么。|#0202Adv19_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:她肯定在谋划什么事吧？<br>我很好奇是什么事！|#0202Adv19_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Sherry-Front Loop:false
