@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:听到我的话，<br>奈叶香的表情顿时变得僵硬。|#0202Adv19_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你……不，我明白了，二阶堂希罗。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你一直都善于观察别人。<br>是个能冷静看待事物，并妥善处理的人。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

