; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:嘿嘿嘿～<br>今天我要宣布一件大事哦。|#0202Adv19_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:锵锵～！大家看看这个！|#0202Adv19_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『トレデキム』表示
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:其实这个啊，是【杀死魔女的药】哦～|#0202Adv19_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:它的名字叫【特雷德基姆】。<br>效果有我亲自担保！|#0202Adv19_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来还在犹豫要不要告诉大家这个信息……<br>因为如果说出来的话，<br>我可能也会陷入危险的境地吧。|#0202Adv19_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:但是、但是！我已经拿到【杀死魔女的药】了！<br>再也不会被这种东西杀死了！|#0202Adv19_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:信不信由你们！<br>总之，如果不使用这种【杀死魔女的药】，<br>就绝对无法杀死魔女！|#0202Adv19_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

