[PrintTextModified Text:把药给我。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【杀死魔女的药】。<br>就在你手里吧。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～又提这个？你真的好烦欸。<br>不是说了我没有嘛。|#0202Adv19_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别想蒙混过关。<br>你偷偷藏着药早已是众所周知的事实了。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我可不能让你拿着那么危险的药物。<br>你打算用在魔女身上对吧？|#0202Adv19_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托，<br>如果真出现了魔女，肯定是用药杀了比较好吧。|#0202Adv19_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:要是我搞清楚谁成了魔女，<br>我肯定是能用多少用多少啊。|#0202Adv19_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来就不会发生凶杀案，<br>我也能成为解决问题的英雄不是嘛？|#0202Adv19_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL8,OptionB_Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……你是认真的吗？<br>你的意思是，只要是魔女，杀掉也无所谓？|#0202Adv19_Nanoka012| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不明白你干嘛那么拼命阻拦我啦，<br>但只要是魔女的话，死就死呗。|#0202Adv19_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv19_Nanoka013| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我只要自己安全就行，其他的事怎样都好。<br>因为我一定、一定要生存到最后，然后回家。|#0202Adv19_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了活下去，我会用药的。|#0202Adv19_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

; ＠備考◆面倒になって煽り気味

[PrintTextModified Text:啊！对了！<br>不是已经有个显而易见的【魔女】了嘛！|#0202Adv19_Coco015| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不对，确切地说，我也不清楚到底是不是同一种东西。|#0202Adv19_Coco016| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过……总归值得试一试吧？|#0202Adv19_Coco017| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆くっと息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Angry1,OptionB_Off

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka014| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

; ＠備考◆面倒になって煽り気味

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么我一直没注意到呢～<br>你说得对，嗯嗯。现在我知道该给谁下药了。|#0202Adv19_Coco018| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:要是没有它，说不定我们就能出去了。<br>多谢啦奈叶香。那我先走了。|#0202Adv19_Coco019| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

