; ========================================
; 回想シーン（ここまで）
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:……现在想来，当时的那些话<br>也许并不是她的真心话。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka017| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而我却当真了，不禁一时冲动……<br>结果自己从垃圾滑槽掉下去了。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka018| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样从昏迷中醒来后，<br>在焚烧炉里，我的手碰到了枪。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka019| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR5,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:碰到枪的瞬间，【幻视】发动了。<br>把枪丢在焚烧炉里的人，是宝生玛格。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka020| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:她为了杀死冰上梅露露，<br>从保险箱里拿走的东西不只有特雷德基姆和剑，<br>还有手枪。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka021| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，她可能最后放弃了用枪杀人吧。<br>也许是害怕被其他人拿去杀人，<br>便把手枪丢进了焚烧炉里。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka022| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那把手枪就在我手里，<br>打开炉盖后映入眼帘的<br>恰好是泽渡可可的身影……|#0202Adv19_Nanoka023| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一定是鬼迷心窍了。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka024| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

