[PrintTextModified Text:……你确实犯下了过错。<br>但是，我有一个疑问。|#0202Adv19_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可真的在担心你吗？|#0202Adv19_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,45 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:她用焚烧炉室的墙伪造背景开直播，<br>难道不是为了给自己制造不在场证明，<br>万一你死了就可以用来脱罪——|#0202Adv19_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Hiro-Front Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Hiro-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:或许……是这样吧。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka025| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是……<br>她像是要哭出来似的，担心地看着我的样子，<br>也是千真万确的事实。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka026| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……说真的，我没有什么可狡辩的。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka027| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:快点开始处刑吧。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka028| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

