[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。<br>拖得太久也不太好呢。<br>各位，请开始惯例的程序吧～|#0202Adv19_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不必顾虑也不必纠结。<br>……如果你们对我还留一丝同情，<br>就尽快结束这恶心的时间吧。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka029| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

