[PrintTextModified Text:在难以释怀的氛围中，<br>我们拿出手机。|#0202Adv19_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:搞不懂，我真的搞不懂啊。<br>该死的……|#0202Adv19_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我听见了亚里沙的嘟哝声。<br>我的心情和她一样。|#0202Adv19_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（鬼迷心窍——<br>　但是，应该有压死骆驼的最后一根稻草）|#0202Adv19_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（奈叶香不愿说那是什么。<br>　她看起来甚至有些着急）|#0202Adv19_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们真的该<br>　就这样放任奈叶香被处刑吗……？）|#0202Adv19_Hiro015|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

