[PrintTextModified Text:齿轮开始转动，<br>中央的底座被缓缓替换。|#0202Adv19_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那夸张的运转方式甚至给人一种庄严而神圣的感觉。|#0202Adv19_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

