[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着——新出现的是<br>固定在底座上的加特林炮。|#0202Adv19_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那光泽沉闷的金属巨物<br>散发着身为杀人工具的凶猛气息。|#0202Adv19_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:枪口前方放着一把椅子。|#0202Adv19_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:枪……|#0202Adv19_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:简直就像事先量身定制好的一样……<br>为将枪作为凶器的她而准备的处刑。|#0202Adv19_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……很适合我。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka030| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; スマホ通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_29 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:就在奈叶香快走下证人席的时候，<br>我的手机冷不丁地响了起来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（什么东西……？）|#0202Adv19_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见发送人是【黑部奈叶香】，<br>我便看向她那边。|#0202Adv19_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv19_Nanoka031| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:视线交汇。<br>她别有深意地摇了摇头。|#0202Adv19_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（意思是让我待会再看吗？）|#0202Adv19_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你怎么了？|#0202Adv19_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没什么。|#0202Adv19_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我摇摇头，<br>把手机收进口袋里。|#0202Adv19_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:450_2

[PrintTextModified Text:另一边，奈叶香在看守的押送下坐到椅子上，<br>毫不抵抗地被铐起来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:准备好了吗？<br>那么……|#0202Adv19_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我并不是不害怕。<br>但这样一来，我也能变得和你一样了。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka032| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆小さく呟く

[PrintTextModified Text:……姐姐。|#0202Adv19_Nanoka033| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她只留下这一句呢喃，<br>便静静闭上眼。|#0202Adv19_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有漏掉这句轻语。|#0202Adv19_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……|#0202Adv19_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在意识到真相的瞬间，<br>我感到心底一阵刺痛，好像一把寒冰般的尖刃扎进心里。|#0202Adv19_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香想保护的是——）|#0202Adv19_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哦，这是在做什么？|#0202Adv19_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长发出诧异的声音。|#0202Adv19_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们<br>也被那异常的场面震惊得说不出话。|#0202Adv19_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而奈叶香也是。|#0202Adv19_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_43_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:姐、姐……？|#0202Adv19_Nanoka034| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守站在奈叶香面前。|#0202Adv19_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛化身一座铜墙铁壁，为她阻挡加特林炮的攻击。|#0202Adv19_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么……？<br>为什么看守要保护奈叶香……？|#0202Adv19_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道……<br>可是为什么，感觉心里好难受……|#0202Adv19_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——任谁都能一眼看出那是【魔女】。|#0202Adv19_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香想保护的，<br>正是她曾经的家人。|#0202Adv19_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢的看守，<br>是少女彻底变为魔女后的【残骸】。|#0202Adv19_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:它们原本和我们一样，<br>是曾经被收容在此的囚犯。|#0202Adv19_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:它们或许也有朋友。<br>或许也有家人。|#0202Adv19_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这么理所当然的事实，<br>为什么我直到现在才意识到？|#0202Adv19_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心脏剧烈的跳动声<br>回荡在耳朵深处。|#0202Adv19_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这可怎么办呢……？<br>我应该没下这样的命令啊。|#0202Adv19_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是没洗脑彻底可就麻烦了啊……<br>唉，就这样吧。一起处理掉好了。|#0202Adv19_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_2 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0202Adv19_Nanoka035| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的表情<br>瞬间扭曲起来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么！<br>为什么你总是这样！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka036| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是我们的关系暴露了<br>连你也会受处分的！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka037| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我才一直瞒着没说！！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka038| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你偏偏在这种时候，偏偏对我<br>做出这种事！？姐姐你真傻啊！！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka039| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经不是那个小时候的奈奈了！<br>你总是这样摆出姐姐的架子……|#0202Adv19_Nanoka040| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不要再自顾自地保护我了！<br>最后就让我堂堂正正地走吧！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka041| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 銃声・ガトリング砲
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_133 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香的姐姐化身的看守<br>暴露在枪林弹雨中。|#0202Adv19_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哪怕身体被猛烈的枪击射成一块千疮百孔的破布，<br>看守也依旧保护着哭喊的奈叶香。|#0202Adv19_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手啊啊啊啊……！！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka042| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香悲痛的呼喊<br>被掩埋在轰鸣的枪声中。|#0202Adv19_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.3 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:451_7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:别把我当小孩子了！<br>不要再包庇我了……<br>求你了，快走开吧……！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka043| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别再保护我了……！！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka044| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香像个小孩子一样<br>哭得泣不成声。|#0202Adv19_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与此同时，她的脸上逐渐现出裂痕。|#0202Adv19_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:铐在椅子上的身体如波浪般起伏跳动，<br>逐渐变形。|#0202Adv19_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——因为我是姐姐。|#0202Adv19_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我似乎听到了这样的声音。|#0202Adv19_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明这次该轮到我保护你了！<br>我要干掉所有伤害你的，<br>让你沦落到这般境地的坏东西！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka045| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我明明是抱着这样的决心来的！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka046| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你又要为我牺牲——！|#0202Adv19_Nanoka047| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:那魔女的残骸<br>轻柔地包裹住奈叶香的身体——|#0202Adv19_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样轻而易举地触碰到了<br>奈叶香封锁在内心深处，<br>绝不让任何人窥探的【禁忌】。|#0202Adv19_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; トラウマシーン
; ========================================

