@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:——奈奈。|#0202Adv19_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:姐姐总是对我那么好。|#0202Adv19_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不太善于和人打交道，<br>总是一个人孤零零的。|#0202Adv19_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是姐姐给我系上和她一样的发带作为护身符，<br>时刻陪在我的身边。|#0202Adv19_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我可是姐姐呀？|#0202Adv19_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——有烦恼的时候，<br>尽管和姐姐说就好。|#0202Adv19_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这个世界上，<br>只有姐姐是站在我这一边的。|#0202Adv19_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只会在姐姐面前展露真正的自己。|#0202Adv19_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，也只会和姐姐分享秘密。|#0202Adv19_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:姐姐和我都拥有奇特的魔法。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的魔法是【幻视】。<br>姐姐的魔法是【变身】。|#0202Adv19_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得自己的魔法很奇怪，<br>有点羡慕能变身成我的姐姐。|#0202Adv19_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就像我在电视里见过的魔法少女一样<br>闪闪发光，令人惊叹。|#0202Adv19_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——哎嘿！我的魔法很厉害哦！|#0202Adv19_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我还可以替你参加考试。|#0202Adv19_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——所以呢，就算考得不好也不要哭啦。|#0202Adv19_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一次我触碰姐姐，<br>看到了可怕的未来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以前都只能看到过去，这次不一样。<br>或许是因为我总是粘着姐姐吧。|#0202Adv19_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:19_1
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Duration:2 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:以预备魔女的罪名<br>被当作囚犯抓进牢里的我——|#0202Adv19_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1

[PrintTextModified Text:在魔女的杀人冲动驱使下<br>犯下杀人罪行的我——|#0202Adv19_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:13_1

[PrintTextModified Text:为查明杀人凶手魔女的审判——|#0202Adv19_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以及，被处刑的我——|#0202Adv19_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看到一直戴在头上的护身符发带<br>脱落了下来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:幻视到的那些景象实在是过于恐怖，<br>我害怕得把自己关在房间里。|#0202Adv19_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——奈奈，奈奈你怎么了？|#0202Adv19_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么你不出来呀？|#0202Adv19_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我躲在房间里，<br>一心调查魔女的信息。|#0202Adv19_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拥有魔法的我们，也许会被当作魔女处刑。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是只要检查的时候不被发现，就能躲过一劫。|#0202Adv19_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我把这件事告诉姐姐后，<br>她巧妙地使用【变身】，<br>顺利躲过了自己的检查。|#0202Adv19_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:250_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:——你的检查也交给我处理吧！|#0202Adv19_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:姐姐的语气非常可靠，<br>我便笑着依偎到她身上。|#0202Adv19_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，姐姐【变身】为我的模样——|#0202Adv19_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——替我被抓了。|#0202Adv19_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来我看到的并不是自己的未来。<br>而是姐姐的未来。|#0202Adv19_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:一切都是我的错。|#0202Adv19_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一同度过的幸福时光<br>再也回不来了。|#0202Adv19_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Duration:0 Lazy:false

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_44_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:450_3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:只凭看守的身体，<br>终究无法完全阻挡这无休止的枪击。|#0202Adv19_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:放出的弹幕一并射穿了看守和奈叶香的身体。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人间升腾起血色的烟雾，<br>化作无数只赤蝶飘舞在空中。|#0202Adv19_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:450_4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:无论被射击多少次，<br>看守和奈叶香都没有死去。|#0202Adv19_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:450_5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:漫长的枪击依旧在继续。|#0202Adv19_Narrative092| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知不觉中，<br>奈叶香的叫喊声渐渐变成了可怖的呻吟。|#0202Adv19_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在密集的弹雨下，<br>她彻底变成了异形。|#0202Adv19_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可以了。<br>我看她已经成功变成了魔女残骸，<br>那么处刑就到此为止吧。|#0202Adv19_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills,Stills-Middle Duration:0 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长一声令下，<br>枪击终于停止。|#0202Adv19_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 歯車の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:机关开始运作，<br>处刑台慢慢下降。|#0202Adv19_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而处刑台上，<br>两具残骸宛如相拥般紧贴在一起——|#0202Adv19_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，魔女审判就此闭庭。|#0202Adv19_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长飞走了。|#0202Adv19_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（奈叶香……）|#0202Adv19_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每个人都沉默不语，只有时间不断流逝——|#0202Adv19_Narrative099| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于，<br>少女们迈开沉重的步伐，离开了审判庭。|#0202Adv19_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其中，<br>有一名少女却走向反方向。<br>她向着处刑台走去。|#0202Adv19_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是亚里沙。<br>我感到很讶异，便静静观察她。|#0202Adv19_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的手里拿着发带。|#0202Adv19_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……我在湖边找到了这个，就捡起来了。|#0202Adv19_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被你怀疑，我实在是气不过……<br>所以就算找到了发带，也没有还给你。|#0202Adv19_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我根本不了解她。<br>不了解她的心意……|#0202Adv19_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙紧握着发带，<br>双肩颤抖不已。|#0202Adv19_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Cry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:既然是这么重要的发带，你倒是说出来啊……<br>好好把自己的事情，都告诉大家啊……|#0202Adv19_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:早知道就还给你了。|#0202Adv19_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，真的对不起……|#0202Adv19_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙跪下来，不停责备着自己。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的哭声久久地在审判庭里回荡。<br>|#0202Adv19_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

